+/* Step 4.4D: the Core-1-side half of the FIQ<->loop handoff. Called only
+ * from rpi3_can_server_loop() (rpi3_can_server.c), in its own ordinary
+ * execution - never from FIQ context. Returns false (nothing to do) unless
+ * a frame is actually PENDING.
