+ * service it soon - the only thing that previously re-armed FIQ_CONTROL is
+ * can0_secure_transmit(), i.e. a future, logically unrelated transmit.
+ * This makes Core 1 self-sufficient for draining that backlog instead:
+ * bounded (one read_pending_rx_frame() call, which itself already returns
+ * cleanly and quickly if nothing is pending - not a new loop), and reuses
